name=Zomboid Fixes B42.20
id=ZomboidFixesB42
author=Tien
description=A collection of fixes for Build 42.20, mostly for multiplayer.
description=- Fast Timed Actions makes item transfers quick in multiplayer.
description=- Changing an animal's gender now swaps the animal's model and type with it, and sticks for everyone.
description=- The foraging debug menu works, and added icons can be picked up.
description=- Item editor changes save for items anywhere, not just your own inventory.
description=- The debug Add Fluid option fills rain collectors and other fluid containers for real, and everyone sees it.
description=- Admins with Fast Move on no longer die from falls on stairs (beta).
description=- The admin tag shows for every admin cheat, and can be hidden (off by default).
description=- Items with negative weight are deleted automatically.
description=- Clothing destroyed while worn now stays destroyed after relogging.
description=- Metal and Articulated Metal Shin Armor run speeds are no longer swapped.
description=- Chickens deleted by the game when they finish laying in a hutch are put back.
description=- Hutches and nest boxes get dirty four times more slowly, adjustable.
description=- Guns of Marz attachment tooltips wrap at 200 characters by default instead of stretching across the screen.
description=- Running players no longer vault stair railings by accident.
description=- Fast forward in multiplayer, when every player votes for it; right-click a speed to auto fast forward actions longer than 5 seconds.
description=- Shift-click selects a full range with Nick's Inventory Selection Fix.
description=- Turbo Game cartridges, batteries, best scores and mood effects work on servers, best scores are kept per console, playing no longer moves your character, and games close near zombies or in the dark.
description=- Admins who join are fully healed and briefly in god mode, so a revived admin does not die again (off by default).
description=- Admins can change any player's body stats (hunger, mood, health, calories, weight and more) like the debug Body panel, and the changes stick for everyone.
description=- Admins can send and stop the chopper from the right-click Tools menu, and stopping it reaches every player, even one who still hears a chopper that already left (beta).
description=- An admin hotbar: one-click shortcuts to every admin tool, each with its own settings and optional extra steps, opened from the sidebar (single player: with -debug).
description=- Picking a square in the debug Horde Manager or Tile Picker no longer walks your character there.
description=- Mod options of mods that are not loaded are no longer reset or deleted when you save the options (enable this mod in the main menu too).
description=Must be installed on both the server and clients. Every fix is on by default and can be turned off in the sandbox options; the few that are off by default say so.
modversion=1.0
